        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Claflin, Emilia Clarke, Thea Sharrock, Jojo Moyes, Sean Bean, Corey Sevier, Steve Peacocke, Jenna Coleman, Charles Dance, Matthew Lewis, Janet McTeer, Vanessa Kirby, Joanna Lumley, Erich Lee\n- Films: Me Before You, The Lost Future, The Hunger Games film series\n- Characters: Finnick Odair, Philip Swift, Will Traynor\n- Music: Unsteady, Unsteady (Erich Lee Gravity Remix)\n- Topics: film adaptation, motion picture soundtrack\n\nFacts:\n- Sam Claflin is known for portraying Finnick Odair in The Hunger Games film series and Will Traynor in Me Before You.\n- Me Before You is a 2016 romantic drama film directed by Thea Sharrock in her directorial debut.\n- Me Before You was adapted by Jojo Moyes from her 2012 novel of the same name.\n- Me Before You stars Emilia Clarke, Sam Claflin, Steve Peacocke, Jenna Coleman, Charles Dance, Matthew Lewis, Janet McTeer, Vanessa Kirby, and Joanna Lumley.\n- The Lost Future stars Sean Bean, Corey Sevier, and Sam Claflin.\n- Unsteady has a remix titled Unsteady (Erich Lee Gravity Remix) that was released as a single for the Me Before You motion picture soundtrack.",
